    {
      "id": "motkdgl",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Bacteria"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "n0hf25m",
      "content": "Bacteria are unicellular microorganisms lacking a true nucleus. They reproduce mainly by binary fission."
    },
