      "content": "Viruses"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "oj12nbs",
      "content": "Viruses are extremely small infectious agents composed of genetic material (DNA or RNA) surrounded by a protein coat. They can replicate only inside living host cells."
